DeepSeek Harness Ultimate is an independent community profile and installer.

It is not an official product of DeepSeek AI and does not include the
DeepSeek Harness source code or third-party plugin source code. The installer
fetches selected components from their upstream repositories at pinned commits.

Third-party components retain their own copyright notices and licenses. See
COMPONENTS.md and UPSTREAM.md before redistributing a build that contains them.
